# Out of the house to the street and a look around: the street's draws (2,300 to 3,100 a frame), the open sky.
at 64
tap cross        # Lester's call
at 70
hold ls-up 4.5   # out of the front door
wait 1
hold ls-up 6     # down the drive
wait 1
hold rs-left 4   # the camera round: the sky over Rockford Hills
wait 1
hold rs-up 1.5
wait 2
hold rs-right 4
wait 10
